inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3", "options_en": ["8(1/3)", "9", "9(2/3)", "8"], "options_hi": ["8(1/3)", "9", "9(2/3)", "8"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>27K<sup>6</sup> + 26K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>6</sup> + 27K<sup>3</sup>  -  K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup>(K<sup>3</sup> + 1)  -  1 (K<sup>3</sup> + 1) = 0</p><p>(27K<sup>3</sup>  -  1) (K<sup>3</sup> + 1) = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0 or K<sup>3</sup> + 1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup> = 1 or K = -1</p><p>K<sup>3</sup> = 1/27</p><p>K = 1/3</p><p>Positive value of [2K + (3/K)]</p><p>= [(2/3) + 3 * 3]</p><p>= 9(2/3).</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>27K<sup>6</sup> + 26K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>6</sup> + 27K<sup>3</sup>  -  K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup>(K<sup>3</sup> + 1)  -  1 (K<sup>3</sup> + 1) = 0</p><p>(27K<sup>3</sup>  -  1) (K<sup>3</sup> + 1) = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup>  -  1 = 0 or K<sup>3</sup> + 1 = 0</p><p>27K<sup>3</sup> = 1 or K = -1</p><p>K<sup>3</sup> = 1/27</p><p>K = 1/3</p><p>Positive value of [2K + (3/K)]</p><p>= [(2/3) + 3 * 3]</p><p>= 9(2/3).</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If (2p + 3)<sup>3</sup> + (3p  -  5)<sup>3 </sup>+ (p  -  2)<sup>3</sup> = (2p + 3)(3p  -  5)(3p  -  6), then what is the value of 'p'?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (2p + 3)<sup>3</sup> + (3p - 5)<sup>3 </sup>+ (p - 2)<sup>3</sup> = (2p + 3)(3p - 5)(3p - 6) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 'p' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["2/3", "1/2", "3/4", "5/6"], "options_hi": ["2/3", "1/2", "3/4", "5/6"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>We know, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ac)</p><p>Here, (2p + 3)<sup>3</sup> + (3p  -  5)<sup>3 </sup>+ (p  -  2)<sup>3</sup> = (2p + 3)(3p  -  5)(3p  -  6) = 3(2p + 3)(3p  -  5)(p  -  2)</p><p>This means, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p><p>Then, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = 0</p><p>And, (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ac) = 0</p><p>So, a + b + c = 0</p><p>Now, (2p + 3) + (3p  -  5) + (p  -  2) = 0</p><p><b>p = 2/3</b></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ac)</p><p>Here, (2p + 3)<sup>3</sup> + (3p  -  5)<sup>3 </sup>+ (p  -  2)<sup>3</sup> = (2p + 3)(3p  -  5)(3p  -  6) = 3(2p + 3)(3p  -  5)(p  -  2)</p><p>This means, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p><p>Then, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup>  -  3abc = 0</p><p>And, (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  ab  -  bc  -  ac) = 0</p><p>So, a + b + c = 0</p><p>Now, (2p + 3) + (3p  -  5) + (p  -  2) = 0</p><p><b>p = 2/3</b></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If x<sup>16</sup>  -  617x<sup>8</sup> + 16 = 0, and x &gt; 0, then find the value of x<sup>2</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>16</sup> - 617x<sup>8</sup> + 16 = 0 &#2324;&#2352; x &gt; 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>2</sup> + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2", "options_en": ["&radic;31", "&radic;29", "&radic;33", "&radic;26"], "options_hi": ["&radic;31", "&radic;29", "&radic;33", "&radic;26"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Given,</p><p><img width=139 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16030/image001.png\"></p><p><img width=115 height=21 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p16030/image002.pn