: ["62", "78", "66", "45"], "options_hi": ["62", "78", "66", "45"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5 + 3 = 11</p><p>x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5 = 11  -  3 = 8</p><p>(x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = 64</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> + 2 = 64</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> = 64  -  2</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> = 62</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5 + 3 = 11</p><p>x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5 = 11  -  3 = 8</p><p>(x&radic;5 + 1/x&radic;5)<sup>2</sup> = 64</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> + 2 = 64</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> = 64  -  2</p><p>5x<sup>2</sup> + 1/5x<sup>2</sup> = 62</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If 1 + a<sup>2</sup> = 2/a, then what will be the value of 3a + 4/a + 5?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 1 + a<sup>2</sup> = 2/a, &#2340;&#2379; 3a + 4/a + 5 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["-2", "8", "12", "13"], "options_hi": ["-2", "8", "12", "13"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>1 + a<sup>2</sup> = 2/a</p><p>a + a<sup>3</sup> = 2</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> + a  -  2 = 0</p><p>a<sup>3</sup>  -  1 + a  -  1 = 0</p><p>(a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + a + 2) = 0</p><p>a = 1 or a<sup>2</sup> + a + 2 = 0 (which is not possible as b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac &lt;0)</p><p>Therefore, a = 1</p><p>Putting the value in the question equation</p><p>3a + 4/a + 5 = 3 + 4 + 5 = 12</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>1 + a<sup>2</sup> = 2/a</p><p>a + a<sup>3</sup> = 2</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> + a  -  2 = 0</p><p>a<sup>3</sup>  -  1 + a  -  1 = 0</p><p>(a - 1)(a<sup>2</sup> + a + 2) = 0</p><p>a = 1 or a<sup>2</sup> + a + 2 = 0 (which is not possible as b<sup>2</sup>  -  4ac &lt;0)</p><p>Therefore, a = 1</p><p>Putting the value in the question equation</p><p>3a + 4/a + 5 = 3 + 4 + 5 = 12</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If u<sup>2</sup> + 7u  -  2 = 0, then what is the value of (u<sup>2</sup> + 14/u)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; u<sup>2</sup> + 7u - 2 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (u<sup>2</sup> + 14/u) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["49", "51", "14", "7"], "options_hi": ["49", "51", "14", "7"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Given, u<sup>2</sup> + 7u  -  2 = 0 ---(1)</p><p>Multiplying above equation by (7/u), we get</p><p>=&gt; 7u + 49  -  14/u = 0 ---(2)</p><p>Equating equation (1), and (2), we get</p><p>u<sup>2</sup> + 7u  -  2 = 7u + 49  -  14/u</p><p>=&gt; u<sup>2</sup> + 14/u = 51</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given, u<sup>2</sup> + 7u  -  2 = 0 ---(1)</p><p>Multiplying above equation by (7/u), we get</p><p>=&gt; 7u + 49  -  14/u = 0 ---(2)</p><p>Equating equation (1), and (2), we get</p><p>u<sup>2</sup> + 7u  -  2 = 7u + 49  -  14/u</p><p>=&gt; u<sup>2</sup> + 14/u = 51</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If 9m<sup>2</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 9m<sup>2</sup> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1", "options_en": ["320", "225", "528", "440"], "options_hi": ["320", "225", "528", "440"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>9m<sup>2</sup> + 1/m<sup>2</sup> = 58</p><p>(3m + 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = 9m<sup>2</sup> + 1/m<sup>2</sup> + 6 = 58 + 6 = 64</p><p>3m + 1/m = 8</p><p>27m<sup>3</sup> + 1/m<sup>3</sup> = (3m + 1/m)<sup>3</sup> -3*3m*(1/m)*(3m + 1/m)</p><p>= 8<sup>3</sup>  -  9*8</p><p>= 512  -  72</p><p>= 440</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>9m<sup>2</sup> + 1/m<sup>2</sup> = 58</p><p>(3m + 1/m)<sup>2</sup> = 9m<sup>2</sup> + 1/m<sup>2</sup> + 6 = 58 + 6 = 64</p><p>3m + 1/m = 8</p><p>27m<sup>3</sup> + 1/m<sup>3</sup> = (3m + 1/m)<sup>3</sup> -3*3m*(1/m)*(3m + 1/m)</p><p>= 8<sup>3</sup>  -  9*8</p><p>= 512  -  72</p><p>= 440</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If x = &radic;5 + 2, what is the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x<sup>4</sup> - 1", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = &radic;5 + 2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x&#8308; - 1)/x&#178; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p>", "options_en": ["8&radic;5", "16&radic;5", "24&radic;5", "30&radic;5"], "options_hi": ["8&radic;5", "16&radic;5", "24&radic;5", "30&radic;5"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Given, x = &radic;5 + 2</p> <p>=&gt; x&#178; = (&radic;5 + 2)&#178; = 5 + 4 + 4&radic;5 = 9 + 4&radic;5</p> <p>=&gt; x&#178; = (9 + 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; 1/x&#178; = 1/(9 + 4&radic;5) = (9 - 4&radic;5)/(81 - 80)</p> <p>=&gt; 1/x&#178; = (9 - 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#178; - 1/x&#178;) = (9 + 4&radic;5) - (9 - 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#178; - 1/x&#178;) = 8&radic;5</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#8308; - 1)/x&#178; = 8&radic;5</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Given, x = &radic;5 + 2</p> <p>=&gt; x&#178; = (&radic;5 + 2)&#178; = 5 + 4 + 4&radic;5 = 9 + 4&radic;5</p> <p>=&gt; x&#178; = (9 + 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; 1/x&#178; = 1/(9 + 4&radic;5) = (9 - 4&radic;5)/(81 - 80)</p> <p>=&gt; 1/x&#178; = (9 - 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#178; - 1/x&#178;) = (9 + 4&radic;5) - (9 - 4&radic;5)</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#178; - 1/x&#178;) = 8&radic;5</p> <p>=&gt; (x&#8308; - 1)/x&#178; = 8&radic;5</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x", "options_en": ["-9261", "441", "9261", "-441"], "options_hi": ["-9261", "441", "9261", "-441"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Short trick:</p><p>If <img width=172 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25009/image012.png\"></p><p>Here, A = 21</p><p>So, x<sup>3</sup> = (-21)<sup>3</sup> = -9261</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Short trick:</p><p>If <img width=172 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p25009/image012.png\"></p><p>Here, A = 21</p><p>So, x<sup>3</sup> = (-21)<sup>3</sup> = -9261</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of the expression, (1 + 2X) (1 + 4X<sup>2</sup>) (1 + 16X<sup>4</sup>) (1 + 256X<sup>8</sup>) (1  -  2X)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; (1 + 2X) (1 + 4X<sup>2</sup>) (1 + 16X<sup>4</sup>) (1 + 256X<sup>8</sup>) (1 - 2X) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["1  -  65536X<sup>32</sup>", "1  -  63536X<sup>16</sup>", "1  -  65536X<sup>16</sup>", "1  -  63536X<sup>32</sup>"], "options_hi": ["1 - 65536X<sup>32</sup>", "1 - 63536X<sup>16</sup>", "1 - 65536X<sup>16</sup>", "1 - 63536X<sup>32</sup>"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p><img width=303 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image061.png\"></p><p><img width=271 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image062.png\"></p><p><img width=221 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image063.png\"></p><p><img width=164 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image064.png\"></p><p><img width=100 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image065.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=303 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image061.png\"></p><p><img width=271 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image062.png\"></p><p><img width=221 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image063.png\"></p><p><img width=164 height=28 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image064.png\"></p><p><img width=100 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20193/image065.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;If a<sup>3</sup> +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>3</sup> + <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1", "options_en": ["0", "1", "2", "5"], "options_hi": ["0", "1", "2", "5"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> +(1/a<sup>3</sup>) =2</p><p>Therefore, when, a= 1</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> +(1/a<sup>3</sup>) =2</p><p>1+1=2</p><p>L.H.S = R.H.S</p><p>Similarly,</p><p>a<sup>18</sup> -(1/a<sup>18</sup>)</p><p>1-1= 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>a<sup>3</sup> +(1/a<sup>3</sup>) =2</p><p>Therefore, when, a= 1</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> +(1/a<sup>3</sup>) =2</p><p>1+1=2</p><p>L.H.S = R.H.S</p><p>Similarly,</p><p>a<sup>18</sup> -(1/a<sup>18</sup>)</p><p>1-1= 0</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}